flowchart TD
    req[Incoming request] --> auth{Valid token?}
    auth -->|missing or invalid| e401[401]
    auth -->|auth not configured| e503[503]
    auth -->|ok| hdr{Workspace header present?}
    hdr -->|no| e400[400 workspace required]
    hdr -->|yes| mem{Member of workspace?}
    mem -->|workspace unknown| e404[404 workspace not found]
    mem -->|not a member| e403[403 access denied]
    mem -->|yes| val{Payload and query valid?}
    val -->|no| e422[422 validation error with field errors]
    val -->|yes| work[Run use case in a transaction]
    work -->|constraint conflict| e409[409 conflict, rolled back]
    work -->|resource missing in workspace| e404b[404 not found]
    work -->|unexpected failure| rb[Rollback]
    work -->|success| ok[200 or 201 with audit event ID]
    e422 --> env[Standard error envelope<br/>code, message, field errors, request ID]
    e409 --> env
    e404 --> env
    e403 --> env
    e400 --> env
